        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Terri Nunn, Sonya Scarlet, Virginia Macolino\n- Organizations: Berlin, Theatres des Vampires\n- Products: Information, Candyland\n- Roles: singer, actress, lyricist, lead vocals\n\nFacts:\n- Terri Nunn was born on June 26, 1961, and Terri Nunn is an American singer and actress.\n- Sonya Scarlet was born on April 2, 1980, and Sonya Scarlet is the singer and lyricist of the Italian extreme gothic metal band Theatres des Vampires.\n- During the recording period of the album Information by Berlin, Terri Nunn had temporarily left Berlin to pursue an acting career, and Virginia Macolino performed the lead vocals.\n- The album Candyland by Theatres des Vampires features Sonya Scarlet on vocals, is more guitar-driven than the band's previous releases, and focuses less on vampiric and occult themes than the band is known for.",
